sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor RA as Credit risk analyst
  participant CK as Cockpit (development)
  participant ENG as Rule Engine
  actor DV as Developer
  participant GIT as Git and CI
  actor CO as Compliance officer
  RA->>CK: New rule set from template "Eligibility with reason codes"
  RA->>CK: Inputs age, monthlyIncome, employmentMonths, dti, outputs eligible, reasonCode
  RA->>CK: Rows in shorthand: age "< 21", monthlyIncome "< 8000000 VND"
  CK->>ENG: validate draft
  ENG-->>CK: plain-language messages per row and column
  RA->>CK: Simulation with 30 sample applicants
  RA->>DV: Ticket: rule set name, inputs, outputs, launch date
  alt an input is not available in the service
    DV-->>RA: dti is not computed today
    DV->>ENG: register function dti(debt, income), or compute it before the call
  end
  DV->>GIT: export draft as YAML, add JUnit tests, wire evaluate in the loan service
  GIT-->>DV: tests green, row coverage report
  GIT->>ENG: UAT: release the service, import rule set as draft
  RA->>ENG: UAT checks, request approval
  CO->>ENG: approve in UAT
  GIT->>ENG: Production: release the service, import rule set as draft
  RA->>ENG: request publication, effective on launch date
  CO->>ENG: approve (journey 3)
  alt service calls before the rule set is effective
    ENG-->>DV: 404 NO_EFFECTIVE_VERSION, the service must keep the product switched off
  end
